            "full_width_enable": false,
            "title": "Setting Up",
            "text": "<p>The LawnMaster 48V 46cm Cordless Lawn Mower requires minimal assembly out of the box.<br/><br/><strong>Assembling the Lower Handle<br/></strong><br/>1. Unfold the lower handle and adjust to the desired operating position. There are three possible positions.<br/>2. Rotate the wing knobs clockwise to tighten. Do not use excessive force; this may damage the knobs.<br/><br/><strong>Assembling the Upper Handle<br/></strong><br/>1. Unfold the upper handle assembly.<br/>2. Align the upper handle and lower handle and secure with the wing knobs.<br/>3. Ensure the cable is secured against the handle frame with the supplied cable fasten strap.<br/><br/><strong>Assembling the Grass Collection Bag </strong><br/><br/>Your mower comes with a tool free grass collection bag.<br/><br/>1. Insert the grass collection bag handle into the slots on the upper cover of grass collection bag. Make sure the arrow mark on the handle aligns with that on the cover of grass collection bag. Ensure this securely 'clicks’ into place.<br/>2. Secure the metal support rods into the fixing position on either side of the grass collection base. Ensure the side clamping sleeves are properly fixed onto the metal support frame.<br/>3. There is a hole in the bottom of the grass collection bag to hang it up if required.<br/><br/><strong>Inserting the Battery Pack<br/></strong><br/>1. Make sure the battery is fully charged.<br/>2. Lift the battery compartment cover on the lawnmower deck.<br/>3. Align the support rails located within the battery compartment with the guides in the batterypack, and then insert the battery pack into the compartment.<br/>4. Push the battery pack until you hear a “click”.<br/>5. Insert the isolator key into the keyholes located within the battery compartment.<br/>6. Close the battery compartment cover.</p>",
            "button_1_style": "black",
            "button_1_text": "",
            "button_1_url": "",
            "button_2_style": "link",
            "button_2_text": "",
            "button_2_url": "",
