            "title": "How do you use the grass bag full indicator?",
            "text": "<p>The grass collection bag full indicator is a small orange flap located on the side of the grass collection box.</p><p><br/>1. If the grass collection box is empty or it is not full with grass, the grass full indicator flap will remain open.</p><p><br/>2. When this flap remains closed it means that the grass collection box is full and needs to be emptied.</p>",
